From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 20:27:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] script: add 16-shard TLS SignatureCache, parallel script
 workers, and batch Schnorr verification

Introduce a 16-shard cuckoo SignatureCache with thread-local lookaside caching,
parallel script verification worker threads (ParallelScriptWorkerPool), and
multi-scalar batch Schnorr verification (BatchSigCollector via
secp256k1_schnorrsig_verify_batch and secp256k1_schnorr_verify_batch) with
binary-search bisection fallback.
